OL,3,AMore than 1.9 million urged to evacuate
OL,4,Aas powerful typhoon batters Japan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPowerful Typhoon Dujuan is battering
OL,7,FTokyo and is forecast to bring record
OL,8,Frainfall - watch live pictures from
OL,9,FJapan by clicking the button above
OL,11,FMore than 1.9 million people across six
OL,12,Fprefectures are under evacuation
OL,13,Forders, with 50,000 households without
OL,14,Fpower
OL,16,FIn Kanagawa, firefighters fear a woman
OL,17,Fhas been buried alive after a landslide
OL,18,Fcrushed a house, while a man in Chiba
OL,19,Fwas taken to hospital after being
OL,20,Ftrapped while working to clear debris
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
